smartinit.v3.4.3  Q1FY16 
December 2015 NAM/DGEX smartinit upgrade to coincide with RTMA/URMA upgrade

- Converted to phase 2.
- Added new grid specifications for expanded CONUS Nest (grid 188) and Puerto Rico 1.25 km domain (grid 254).
- Added local versions of the source codes and executables of cnvgrib, wgrib2 and nam_prdgen.
- Added ceiling height to the master parm files. Uses ceiling height from OPS *bgdawp* files.
- Added ceiling height, hourly total cloud cover, land/sea mask for CONUS Nest, new Puerto Rico/expanded CONUS Nest and wind gust      bugfix code changes to smartinit source code.
- Added hours 00 and 10, 11, and 12 to ak_rtmages files.
- Converted all hourly files and *ak_rtmages* files to GRIB2 for RTMA/URMA.
- Added GRIB2 option for future implementation using Eric's NAM parallel (this option is not used yet; will be implemented in
  Q2FY16).

===================================================================================
1.  Converted to phase 2  

    * The v3.4.3 system was converted to phase 2; specifically the script parm/smart_para_config was changed.

2.  Added new grid specifications for expanded CONUS Nest (grid 188) and Puerto Rico 1.25 km domain (grid 254).

    * Added Terrain, Land/Sea Mask, Weight and master parm files for new expanded CONUS Nest domain (grid 188) and Puerto Rico 1.25        km domain (grid 254).
    * Added GRIB2 AWIPS parm files for new expanded CONUS Nest domain (grid 188) and Puerto Rico 1.25 km domain (grid 254).


3.  Added local versions of the source codes and executables of cnvgrib, wgrib2, nam_prdgen and overgridnum_grib.

        sorc/smartinit_cnvgrib.fd
        sorc/smartinit_prdgen.fd
        sorc/smartinit_wgrib2.cd
        sorc/smartinit_overgridnum_grib.fd

    * Added local versions of cnvgrib, wgrib2, nam_prdgen to jobs/JNAM_SMINIT and jobs/JDGEX_SMINIT

4.  Added ceiling height, hourly total cloud cover, land/sea mask for CONUS Nest, new Puerto Rico/expanded CONUS Nest and wind gust      bugfix.

    * Added ceiling height to the master parm files. 
    * Uses ceiling height from OPS *bgdawp* files.
    * Added hourly total cloud cover
    * CONUS Nest uses land/sea mask to define temps/dewpoint/winds near coastlines 
    * changed grid spacing in code for Puerto Rico from 2500 km to 1250 km.
    * Wind gust is now being read in and used for evaluating wind gust for intermediate hours
    * Added code in smartinit to define expanded CONUS Nest to grid 188 and Puerto Rico 1.25 km to grid 254.

5.  Added hours 00 and 10, 11, and 12 to *ak_rtmages* files.

6.  Converted all hourly files and *ak_rtmages* files to GRIB2 for RTMA/URMA.

7.  Added GRIB switch to ush/smartinit.sh.  
    
    export grib=1 ; for using OPS NAM GRIB1 data
    export grib=2 ; for using parallel NAM GRIB2 data

8.  Added GRIB2 option for future implementation using Eric's NAM parallel (this option is not used yet; will be implemented in
    Q2FY16).

  * added GRIB2 master parm files
  * replaced nam_prdgen with wgrib2
  * added parallel wgrib2
  * added GRIB2 specs for each grid
  * uses parallel 3 km NAM Nests
  * wgrib2 uses nearest neighbor interpolation for 2.5 km CONUS NEst, 3 km Hawaiinest, and 3 km Alaskanest; uses budget for 
    precipitation/snow fields; and bilinear interpolation for all other grids.

#===============================================================================
 IMPLEMENTATION INSTRUCTIONS 
#===============================================================================
1.  svn checkout https://svnemc.ncep.noaa.gov/projects/smartinit/tags/DNG-V3.4.3

2.  Build sorc codes smartinit.fd, smartprecip.fd, smartinit_cnvgrib.fd, smartinit_prdgen.fd, smartinit_wgrib2.cd
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/smartinit.fd
        make
          This will create smartinit  executable in ../../smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/smartprecip.fd
        make
          This will create smartprecip  executable in ../../smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/smartinit_cnvgrib.fd
        make
          This will create smartinit_cnvgrib executable in ../../smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/smartinit_prdgen.fd
        make
          This will create smartinit_prdgen executable in ../../smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/smartinit_overgridnum_grib.fd
        make
          This will create smartinit_overgridnum_grib executable in ../../smartinit.${model_ver}/exec
        cd smartinit.${model_ver}/sorc/smartinit_wgrib2.cd
        make
        cp wgrib2/wgrib2 ../../exec/smartinit_wgrib2
        
3.  Will be running ak_rtmages for 00-12 hours.  Therefore, create ecf/sminit_ak/akrtmages/jnam_sminit_akrtmages_f00.ecf and             ecf/sminit_ak/akrtmages/jnam_sminit_akrtmages_f12.ecf.  Change 5 instances of HH (e.g. 06) to 00 and 12 for each script,             respectively. 

4.  Use ...docs/smartinit.ver file if desired to set
      model_ver=v3.4.3  parameter

NOTE: Details on all changes to nam smartinit are found at docs/README

